, [224.0, 760.0]], "text": "真是小孩子呀，看把他乐得。", "confidence": 0.9179828209536416, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[224.0, 779.0], [618.0, 779.0], [618.0, 802.0], [224.0, 802.0]], "text": "瞧把他得意得，都不知道自已是谁了。", "confidence": 0.8759371505843269, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[224.0, 821.0], [570.0, 821.0], [570.0, 843.0], [224.0, 843.0]], "text": "瞧把他吓得，都不知道说什么了。", "confidence": 0.8980945274233818, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[129.0, 881.0], [346.0, 881.0], [346.0, 904.0], [129.0, 904.0]], "text": "【六64】放着X不Y", "confidence": 0.7698870247060602, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[225.0, 923.0], [646.0, 923.0], [646.0, 946.0], [225.0, 946.0]], "text": "你可别放着好日子不过，在这儿找麻烦。", "confidence": 0.8921044343396237, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[225.0, 965.0], [665.0, 965.0], [665.0, 987.0], [225.0, 987.0]], "text": "他放着好好的学不上，非要跑去外面打工。", "confidence": 0.8979337513446808, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[129.0, 1025.0], [509.0, 1025.0], [509.0, 1048.0], [129.0, 1048.0]], "text": "【六65】×来×去，都是／就是·…·", "confidence": 0.728959637252908, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[224.0, 1067.0], [634.0, 1067.0], [634.0, 1090.0], [224.0, 1090.0]], "text": "不管我们怎么争来争去，都是没有用的", "confidence": 0.9237400988737742, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[223.0, 1105.0], [572.0, 1107.0], [571.0, 1133.0], [223.0, 1131.0]], "text": "说来说去，就是没有统一的意见。", "confidence": 0.8738430216908455, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[128.0, 1168.0], [490.0, 1168.0], [490.0, 1194.0], [128.0, 1194.0]], "text": "【六66】×了就×了，（没）有…", "confidence": 0.7960492460166707, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[221.0, 1208.0], [550.0, 1209.0], [550.0, 1235.0], [221.0, 1234.0]], "text": "坏了就坏了，有什么大不了的？", "confidence": 0.8331131021181742, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[221.0, 1250.0], [570.0, 1248.0], [571.0, 1274.0], [221.0, 1276.0]], "text": "输了就输了，没有什么好难过的。", "confidence": 0.8536411672830582, "needs_review": false}, {"bbox": [[127.0, 1311.0], [524.0, 1312.0], [524.0, 1338.0], [127.0, 1337.0]], "text": "【六67】这／那也不×，那／这也不Y